      "en": "Decomposition Strategies & Domain-Driven Design",
      "description": "探討如何運用 Bounded Context 劃分服務邊界，評估 Monolith vs. Microservices 的取捨，以及避免分散式大泥球（Distributed Monolith）的策略。"
